---
title: Test - View Mermaid Diagram Assertions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant CP as Content Panel
    participant Store as Session Store
    participant HTTP as Artifact Client
    participant API as Artifact API (Server)
    participant MMD as Mermaid Renderer

    Dev->>CP: Clicks .mmd artifact (from list or chat ref)
    CP->>Store: Read selectedArtifact
    Store-->>CP: ArtifactRef (path, label)
    Note right of Store: assert selectedArtifact is not null
    Note right of Store: assert path ends with .mmd

    CP->>HTTP: fetchArtifact(path)
    HTTP->>API: GET /artifacts/{path}
    API-->>HTTP: Raw mermaid content
    Note right of API: assert response status 200
    Note right of API: assert response body is non-empty string

    HTTP-->>CP: string (mermaid)
    CP->>MMD: Render mermaid content
    MMD-->>CP: SVG output
    Note right of MMD: assert output contains SVG element
    Note right of MMD: assert no mermaid parse errors

    CP->>Dev: Display rendered diagram
    Note right of CP: assert content panel shows SVG, not raw mermaid text
    Note right of CP: assert file path shown in content header
    Note right of CP: assert diagram is pannable/zoomable
